      <h1 class="jr-h1">Collagen Side Effects: Which Ones Are Real, and Who Should Avoid It?</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">Most pages on this question either say "no side effects" or recycle a scare about organ damage, and neither is honest. Here is what trials actually recorded, the four groups who genuinely need to ask a doctor first, and the arithmetic on our own label.</p>

